Select graphics at early init: QEMU's Mesa softpipe fallback or the laptop's ANGLE/RADV
profile. The selected profile owns the HWUI renderer. Keep SDR; drop when Google supports these GPUs.
The composer looks for xe's LOG_GAMMA_LUT on every frame when use_log_gamma_lut is set; other
drivers lack it, so it logged a fallback each frame. With the color pipeline off it only clears
GAMMA_LUT either way.

